                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-dashed border-2 border-black bg-white p-4 text-green-700">
                        <span class="text-4xl font-black leading-none">2</span>
                        <span class="mt-1 text-md font-bold text-slate-600">
                            Campionati individuali di tennis e padel con sistemi punteggio dedicati, classifiche separate, sfide libere e playoff finali
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="relative left-1/2 mb-16 w-screen -translate-x-1/2 scroll-mt-24 border-y-2 border-black bg-black py-12 text-white">
